We are looking to move from VMS to DU in our planning we found that the 200's
would not work with DU.

You can load a DS 300 with MOP or BOOTP but you can only load a 200 with MOP.
VMS can load a terminal server via MOP (Lat) or BOOTP if TCP/IP is installed on
that system. DU only comes with BOOTP.  So you cannot load a 200 from a vanilla
DU. You can purchase MOP but I think it costs some $. You can replace 200 with
300's or the old DS 90 (really basic but don't need a load).

