That will work, but it can be done without a ~/.netrc file:

Create a command file: ftp_commands:

open ftp_site_address
user user_name password
cd /dir/to/the/file
lcd /local/dir/to/put/the/file
bin (or asc)
get name_of_the_file (or mget wildcard_specification)
bye

Now issue the command:
ftp -n <ftp_commands





