> Hi,
> Howto download a file via ftp (anonymous) automatically by using
> crontab ?
> I try in my cron file:
> 0 2 25 12 * /home/users/quy/mydownload
> 
> With my script "mydownload". Which command I can put in my script
> for automatic downloading ?

# call as "download <HOST> <Your EMail> <file>
cat > ~/.netrc << EOF
machine $1
user anonymous
pass $2
EOF

ftp $1 << EOT
get $4
bye
EOT

---------------

Nix.



