Strictly speaking, screen resolution has nothing to do with CDE. CDE is
a "X Windows environment". It contains DT Session manager (dtsession),
DT Window Manager (dtwm) and more stuff. Still, it relies on the X
Windows System to do the actual drawing.

So, you need to change the resolution of X Windows. The file containing
the configuration is:
/usr/lib/X11/Xserver.conf

I'm not sure what the actual arguments are, but I'm sure I've seen it.

Nix.
