entry. Maybe new version of OS, has new entries (unlikely, but...). You
could try to re-create them.

SRV:/# cd /dev
SRV:/# rm *rmt0?
SRV:/# ./MAKEDEV tz5 # Supposing 5 is the SCSI ID of the tape

