we've recently started  running Digital UNIX 4.0D, with LSM. I had
assumed that the volwatch utility which is started by default would
notify me of all errors like dropping mirror copies.

But while testing today I discovered that mail is only sent for plexes
with state DISABLED - NODEVICE, where the device had dropped out of its
group. Other plexes had state DETACHED - IOFAIL, but this was not
reported by volwatch.

Reading the manual didn't help much, but in the man pages for volnotify
I found a script which when run sent me a mail reporting both these
error conditions. My question to you experienced Digital UNIX system
managers is, how are you supervising LSM to get all kinds of relevant
notifications?

